  "description": "LiteGraph backend for Durable ORM (depends on the LiteGraph package): stores each entity row as a node of a LiteGraph property graph, maintains foreign keys as edges, uses deterministic node GUIDs for key lookups, supports atomic interactive transactions, includes and full LINQ query evaluation, so Durable data is first-class for LiteGraph traversals, algorithms and tools.",
  "iconFile": "logo.png",
  "id": "Durable.LiteGraph",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-10-07T01:22:26.827Z",
