  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/jchristn/durable",
  "published": "2026-10-07T01:19:16.13Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.5.0: initial release. LiteGraphBackend.Create/CreateAsync with LiteGraphRepositorySettings.ForInMemory/ForFile/ForClient; rows as nodes with deterministic GUIDs, foreign keys as edges (RebuildEdgesAsync); push-down of labels, keys and exact equality; atomic interactive transactions (MaxOperationsPerTransaction, TransactionTimeout); QueryPlanned/LastQueryPlan; passes the full conformance kit. Not Native AOT-compatible yet (the LiteGraph library uses reflection-based System.Text.Json).",
